ROOT CAUSE being fixed (D58, D59, D64, D65): the truth gate never consults
claimExecutionEvidence — the backend's own per-id mutation record — so a mutation turn is
gated by MODEL-controlled signals (did it emit a mutation claim? did it set a
pendingAction?) instead of by what actually executed. D60/D62 are output-side: model text
reaches the founder through channels the D53/D54 sanitizers did not cover.

